+### SaveHTML
+
+`Document.SaveHTML`, `Document.SaveSVG`, `Document.SaveEpub`, and `Document.ConvertToPDFA` enable exporting PDF content to HTML, `SVG`, EPUB, and PDF/A formats respectively.
